00:42:22.125 --> 00:42:23.250
So let's do that right now.

00:42:23.250 --> 00:42:29.060
So we'll say
tab_style, and we'll

00:42:29.060 --> 00:42:34.820
make it on the locations, which
equals to cells_row_groups.

00:42:34.820 --> 00:42:36.750
And it just needs all of them.

00:42:36.750 --> 00:42:40.040
And the first argument is
actually the style itself.

00:42:40.040 --> 00:42:42.080
We want to change the
text and the background,

00:42:42.080 --> 00:42:46.490
so we'll put it in a list,
and make sure there's a comma.

00:42:46.490 --> 00:42:50.120
Cell_text, we'll say
the color of the text

00:42:50.120 --> 00:42:53.990
is going to be a CSS
color called snow.

00:42:53.990 --> 00:42:57.630
The weight, we'll make it bold.

00:42:57.630 --> 00:43:00.430
And we'll align it to the right.

00:43:00.430 --> 00:43:04.450
It may not make much of a
difference, but let's try it.

00:43:04.450 --> 00:43:06.120
OK, so we have that.

00:43:06.120 --> 00:43:09.810
Now we'll do cell_fill.

00:43:09.810 --> 00:43:14.160
And now we want the
color to be slate gray.

00:43:14.160 --> 00:43:16.470
I do it in caps because
that's how it is in CSS,

00:43:16.470 --> 00:43:18.240
but you can do it
in all lowercase.

00:43:18.240 --> 00:43:19.500
It's the same thing.

00:43:19.500 --> 00:43:21.160
And we'll add an
alpha that's actually

00:43:21.160 --> 00:43:23.340
an argument here of 0.5.

00:43:23.340 --> 00:43:25.470
So blends a bit nicely
with the background

00:43:25.470 --> 00:43:27.760
we may add in the future.

00:43:27.760 --> 00:43:30.660
OK, so let's add this.

00:43:30.660 --> 00:43:33.010
It takes a little while,
but it's worth it.

00:43:33.010 --> 00:43:34.620
So now we have this.

00:43:34.620 --> 00:43:37.135
Great, good stuff.

00:43:37.135 --> 00:43:38.260
Now we'll do another thing.

00:43:38.260 --> 00:43:41.350
There's this other opt
function called opt_all_caps.

00:43:41.350 --> 00:43:42.600
It just adds a bit more style.

00:43:42.600 --> 00:43:47.490
It makes the surrounding
chrome in this caps type

00:43:47.490 --> 00:43:51.390
