00:47:12.570 --> 00:47:13.230
Sorry.

00:47:13.230 --> 00:47:16.560
here we go.

00:47:16.560 --> 00:47:18.690
Great, so now we have those.

00:47:18.690 --> 00:47:23.880
OK, another thing we
need to do is footnotes.

00:47:23.880 --> 00:47:27.030
There's this multi-line
